Nivel de vechime: Asociat
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Servicii IT și consultanță IT
Who We Are
 NTT DATA Romania is looking for a .NET Developer to join our Internal Tools Team.
In this role, you will contribute to the development of applications from scratch, configure and enhance existing systems, and provide support for internal web applications that help our teams work more efficiently and effectively.
 What You'll Be Doing
Design and develop internal applications and new application modules from scratch;
Contribute to the support, maintenance, and continuous improvement of new and existing applications;
Test, deploy, and monitor applications and systems to ensure reliability and performance;
Review, update, refactor, and debug existing code;
Identify opportunities to enhance and optimize existing software solutions;
Write clean, scalable, and maintainable code using .NET technologies;
Participate in requirements analysis and contribute to the definition of technical solutions;
Take an active role in daily stand-ups and other Agile team activities.
 What you'll bring along
Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, Engineering, Cybersecurity, Information Security, or a related field;
Minimum 4–5 years of hands-on experience with C# and .NET Core;
Solid knowledge of SQL Server;
Practical experience with TypeScript, HTML, CSS, and React or Angular;
Basic knowledge of Web APIs and web application architecture;
Good understanding of Agile methodologies and software development practices;
Strong communication and organizational skills, with a customer-oriented mindset;
Collaborative, team-oriented, and solution-driven approach;
High level of self-motivation, with a structured, independent, and results-oriented way of working;
Proficiency in English is mandatory.
